<http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/CapabilityStatement/NMDPDonorAPICapabilityStatement> a fhir:CapabilityStatement ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "NMDPDonorAPICapabilityStatement"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement NMDPDonorAPICapabilityStatement</b></p><a name=\"NMDPDonorAPICapabilityStatement\"> </a><a name=\"hcNMDPDonorAPICapabilityStatement\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">NMDP Donor API Capability Statement</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 0.1.0 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>json</code>, <code>xml</code></li><li>Published on: 2026-07-23 </li><li>Published by: National Marrow Donor Program (NMDP) </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h3 id=\"shallIGs\">SHALL Support the Following Implementation Guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"index.html\">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/ImplementationGuide/nmdp.fhir.donor-patient</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>The NMDP Donor API server provides RESTful access to donor information for authorized transplant centers.</p>\n</div></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Patient1-1\">Patient</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-patient.html\">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-donor-patient</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>identifier, _id</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Observation1-2\">Observation</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-hla-genotype.html\">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-hla-genotype</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>subject, code</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ServiceRequest1-3\">ServiceRequest</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-order.html\">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-donor-order</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>subject, identifier</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Organization1-4\">Organization</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-organization.html\">http://fhir.nmdp.org/ig/donor-patient/StructureDefinition/nmdp-organization</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>identifier, name</td><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Patient1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Patient</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-patient.html\">NMDP Donor Patient</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Search by NMDP Donor ID or GRID</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>_id</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Observation1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Observation</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-hla-genotype.html\">NMDP HLA Genotype Observation</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>subject</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Search HLA observations by donor Patient reference</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>code</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"ServiceRequest1-3\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>ServiceRequest</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-donor-order.html\">NMDP Donor Order</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>subject</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Search orders by donor Patient reference</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>identifier</td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Search by NMDP Order ID</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Organization1-4\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Organization</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-nmdp-organization.html\">NMDP Organization</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b